{
  "_": [
    "THE FOURTEEN OFFICIAL ICON PACKS. ONE TABLE, TWO READERS.",
    "",
    "This file exists because the same fourteen rows were living in TypeScript",
    "inside the admin panel, where a shell script cannot reach them. Publishing",
    "from the panel meant clicking a button; publishing from a script meant a",
    "second copy of the table that would drift the first time a colour changed.",
    "",
    "So the table moved here. `distro-recipes.ts` should import it rather than",
    "re-declare it, and `build-official-packs.mjs` reads it directly.",
    "",
    "TINTS ARE THE DISTROS' OWN BRAND COLOURS, which is why six of them are blue",
    "and why Arch and Zorin are nearly identical. That is a known and accepted",
    "cost of using real brand values rather than a spread palette. Every one",
    "clears 3:1 against a dark plate; Fedora at 3.7:1 is the tightest, so a",
    "darker plate is the thing that breaks first.",
    "",
    "Changing a value here changes a SHIPPED PRODUCT. It is not a design token."
  ],

  "base": {
    "packId": "arcticons-line",
    "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
    "attribution": "Arcticons by Donnnno, CC BY-SA 4.0",
    "_": [
      "The geometry all fourteen point at: 13,622 drawings, 10.58 MB, published",
      "once. Never listed on device: it has no colour of its own, so it would",
      "appear as a fifteenth pack nobody would choose.",
      "",
      "Attribution is REPEATED into every derived pack rather than inherited.",
      "CC BY-SA requires the credit to travel with the work, and the fourteen",
      "are what a user actually receives. Seventy bytes each."
    ]
  },

